---
import { CONTACT } from '../../consts';
---

<div class="mx-auto max-w-xl rounded-2xl border border-sparrow-rule dark:border-dark-rule bg-sparrow-sage dark:bg-dark-surface p-8 text-center shadow-card">
  <h1 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold">Thank you — a real person will be in touch.</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 text-sparrow-ink/80 dark:text-dark-text/80">
    Your message just reached our team here at Sparrow. We read every note personally, and someone
    will reach out within two business days.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3 text-sparrow-ink/80 dark:text-dark-text/80">
    If it's time-sensitive, please call us directly at {CONTACT.twinOaks.phone} (Twin Oaks) or
    {' '}{CONTACT.lifeChange.phone} (LifeChange).
  </p>
  <a href="/" class="btn-primary mt-6">Back to home</a>
</div>
